  time_limit: 10
)
```

## MaxSAT

A WCNF source, here in the format without a problem line, and clasp, which searches
until the model is optimal. Expected: **Satisfiable**, `optimum found`, `cost 2`, the
last model `1 -2`.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGFzcF9tYXhzYXQiLCJpbnB1dCI6bnVsbCwibGFuZ3VhZ2UiOiJ3Y25mIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInJvbGVzIjp7fSwic291cmNlIjoiYyBleGFjdGx5IG9uZSBvZiB4MSBhbmQgeDI7IHgxIGlzIHdvcnRoIDMsIHgyIGlzIHdvcnRoIDJcbmggMSAyIDBcbmggLTEgLTIgMFxuMyAxIDBcbjIgMiAwXG4iLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6IiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Dimacs.Engines.ClaspMaxsat,
  "c exactly one of x1 and x2; x1 is worth 3, x2 is worth 2\nh 1 2 0\nh -1 -2 0\n3 1 0\n2 2 0\n",
  time_limit: 10
)
```

## QBF

A QDIMACS source and DepQBF, found on `PATH` or named in the settings (not in nixpkgs).
Expected: **Satisfiable** (the formula is true), the partial certificate `1`.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Depqbf,
  "c exists x1, for all x2, exists x3: x1, x2 or x3, not both x2 and x3\np cnf 3 3\ne 1 0\na 2 0\ne 3 0\n1 0\n2 3 0\n-2 -3 0\n",
  time_limit: 10
)
```

Expected: **Unsatisfiable** (false), the partial certificate `-1`: the value of the
universal x1 for which no x2 works.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJkZXBxYmYiLCJpbnB1dCI6bnVsbCwibGFuZ3VhZ2UiOiJxZGltYWNzIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInJvbGVzIjp7fSwic291cmNlIjoiYyBmb3IgYWxsIHgxLCBleGlzdHMgeDI6IHgyIDwtPiB4MSwgYW5kIHgxIG9yIHgyXG5wIGNuZiAyIDNcbmEgMSAwXG5lIDIgMFxuLTEgMiAwXG4xIC0yIDBcbjEgMiAwXG4iLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6IiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Depqbf,
  "c for all x1, exists x2: x2 <-> x1, and x1 or x2\np cnf 2 3\na 1 0\ne 2 0\n-1 2 0\n1 -2 0\n1 2 0\n",
  time_limit: 10
)
```

## Linting

Expected: under the editor, variable 4 exceeds the header and the clause count
differs from it; evaluating raises `Loge.Error` with both findings.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGFzcCIsImlucHV0IjpudWxsLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6ImRpbWFjcyIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsibW9kZWxzIjoxLCJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInJvbGVzIjp7fSwic291cmNlIjoicCBjbmYgMyAzXG4xIC00IDBcbjIgMFxuIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiIifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Clasp, "p cnf 3 3\n1 -4 0\n2 0\n", models: 1, time_limit: 10)
```

Expected: under the editor, the innermost quantifier set is universal, which QDIMACS
does not allow.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJkZXBxYmYiLCJpbnB1dCI6bnVsbCwibGFuZ3VhZ2UiOiJxZGltYWNzIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInJvbGVzIjp7fSwic291cmNlIjoicCBjbmYgMiAxXG5lIDEgMFxuYSAyIDBcbjEgMiAwXG4iLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6IiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Depqbf, "p cnf 2 1\ne 1 0\na 2 0\n1 2 0\n", time_limit: 10)
```
